---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-08-29';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Archive terms"
  description="Terms for inspecting the archived Verified Bases storefront experiment."
>
  <section class="container-page pt-14 pb-8 md:pt-20">
    <p class="kicker">Archive terms</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl text-balance">
      Nothing on this site is currently offered for sale.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-faint">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-page max-w-3xl pb-24">
    <div class="space-y-8 text-[16px] text-muted leading-relaxed text-pretty">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Research surface</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Verified Bases is retained to document a storefront, verification, pricing,
          and fulfilment thesis. Prices, tiers, licences, previews, and delivery paths
          shown in the archive are historical design evidence, not active offers.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg">No transaction contract</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The archive does not accept payment, create orders, provision products,
          transfer source-code licences, promise support, or establish service levels.
          Opening a retained preview or reading a listing does not create a buyer relationship.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-fg">Third-party material</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          External previews, tools, and named alternatives remain subject to their own
          terms. Do not treat archived comparison copy as a current endorsement or guarantee.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
